{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6c73d0953504497c48083b4d989e45dfe11efb6ac203343cecdc9aed91b2b388", "ja": "（『劇場を全国に届ける』をコンセプトに\nスタートした、ミリオンシアターシーズン……）", "zh": "（以“让剧场走遍全国”为理念而启动的百万剧场巡演季……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6f1db0e60d7f4230361a9955aff7eecb9941b139a16c68e2187bfd1ee0524a1d", "ja": "（その、全国各地を巡る地方ツアーが終わった。\n残すところは、いよいよ……）", "zh": "（那场巡回全国各地的地方巡演结束了。剩下的终于就是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "da442b48054c12926421ad276e0280fc44f9387556beb9c5eb16e9b80e431ecd", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nなんだか気合いが入っていますね？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n感觉您干劲十足呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "c39916c7847ebed1fd87f9de7cd9aea526e88b339caac98c06c3eabb63fa3181", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまです！　えへへ……そうなんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！嘿嘿……是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "6b6cd7338210ed0e0eb4f916325b89116e65315c75b0157b46d45c4cae09b1db", "ja": "頑張っているみんなのことを考えたら、\n私も、もっと頑張らなきゃ！って。", "zh": "一想到大家都在努力，\n我也得更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5b39c7166c60ec1a941ec8e38c2a9722ee49e27132a4f95c56245148354c1b7e", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nでも、今でも十分、頼らせてもらっていますよ。", "zh": "谢谢您！\n不过，我现在已经很依赖您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "e0970f6296623ab308d482295e190abbd035c36b6bf54be1ca394ff2029d331f", "ja": "えへへ♪　もっともっと頼ってくれても、\n大丈夫ですから！　遠慮しないでくださいね。", "zh": "诶嘿嘿♪　你可以更多更多地依靠我，没关系的！请不要客气哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "37190c06a4c79bc22c0fab52f75eac24b9ccb3af772038bd5486f9f0f761ce76", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　……あ、そうだ。\nすみません、早速お願いになってしまいますけど……。", "zh": "谢谢！……啊，对了。不好意思，这么快就要拜托您了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "592606e090cc1b6321d5d66a6547b1a4c74c0940da796afccd2673521c0afa33", "ja": "今から社長と、今後の打ち合わせがあって。\n事務所に行くので、留守番をお願いしていいですか？", "zh": "我现在要和社长商量一下今后的安排。\n我要去事务所，可以拜托你帮忙留守吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "9b9aee9c8075c3a68511c178763de63e1deaf577de4a2308e89b16ea6d77c27c", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！\nこの劇場は、私が責任を持って守り抜きますから！", "zh": "好的，当然可以！\n这座剧场就交给我，我一定会负责守护到底！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "532063075727b9337b75f6128e18b69c5b409858dcb8b87f7314d0e008056aa2", "ja": "いってらっしゃーい♪　……むんっ！", "zh": "一路顺风～♪……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "dc4a726cfec1d2fbe34a9b27a7e10c0ce65e2963bb3a3c6d0d52131a4b4883a9", "ja": "おお君、待っていたよ！\nそれでは、すぐ打ち合わせを始めよう。", "zh": "哦，你来了，我等你很久了！\n那么，我们马上开始商谈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "f3c0e303a0d0f2da46346bc9aa37a234f2a507095aab35b048eb5f7d37054a20", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん。\n社長ったら、早く話したくてしょうがないみたいで。", "zh": "不好意思，{$P$}先生。\n社长他好像迫不及待地想和您聊聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "564f8159c8ae0cbcdc38090745e00c173a5fe1e6fd4ddad050598118dd5635a3", "ja": "お疲れさまです！\nいよいよですね、社長！", "zh": "辛苦了！\n终于要开始了呢，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "ff6f437a62a37d0b01680f8aaf471ae1aeb25b71bd654fba3051bc065289165b", "ja": "うむ！　いや、だがまずは、ここしばらくの\nツアー公演の成功を、労わせてくれたまえ。", "zh": "嗯！不，不过首先，先让我为这段时间\n巡演的成功，向你们道声辛苦了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "c7716655d7abf28665206fdd0e5f08a05eae4e394794feb57fc1494e3167c889", "ja": "君のプロデュース活動によって、我が765プロの誇る\nアイドル達の輝きを、全国各地に届けることができた！", "zh": "在你的制作工作之下，我们765事务所引以为傲的\n偶像们的光芒，得以传递到了全国各地！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "702a20e3646c3c221e96402577b7fc0cd7d21d54b71a501a8c6817d932197a57", "ja": "そしてその過程で、彼女達もまた輝きを増し、\n成長していった……本当に、よくやってくれたね！", "zh": "在这个过程中，她们也变得更加闪耀，逐渐成长起来……真的辛苦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "8f37dee55a14968ec29d6d5fe234900d030f69d3ad850cd47af0ddf61925ad2b", "ja": "ひとつひとつが、鮮明に記憶に残るような……\n個性的な公演ばかりでしたよね。", "zh": "每一场公演都独具特色，让人一场场都记忆犹新呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "123e46bad72852d085b8878b68d89e2432257690ac6d3772927e949dd61e8768", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　アイドルが力を発揮した、\nいいツアーになったと思います。", "zh": "非常感谢！我认为偶像们充分发挥了实力，\n完成了一场很棒的巡演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "26f4bf2e51b6fbf2de3f2a94359e08d5dda94b9a9a26fa65e5b66cca522ca490", "ja": "ははは、相変わらず謙虚だね！\nとにかく、今こそ君達の成果を示す時だと思うんだ。", "zh": "哈哈哈，你还是一如既往地谦虚呢！\n总之，我觉得现在正是展现你们成果的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "ecb145c1cc2830e567a1ed2f95000ec8470c3710fd1acba0a7160b6f1a368b26", "ja": "そこで……集大成として、最後に首都圏での\nツアー公演を開催したい！　題して……せーのっ！", "zh": "所以……作为集大成，最后想在首都圈举办巡演公演！主题是……一、二！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "d62cddd7fc307c0d874bebe8072ba6d3c65fd374a44927a0d97b7fbdff335154", "ja": "『ミリオンシアターシーズン・ファイナル』！！", "zh": "『MILLION THEATER SEASON FINAL』！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "d62cddd7fc307c0d874bebe8072ba6d3c65fd374a44927a0d97b7fbdff335154", "ja": "『ミリオンシアターシーズン・ファイナル』！！", "zh": "『MILLION THEATER SEASON FINAL』！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4ff16e3b8124cd3c2926e6f898f574e572fa0e11fc2569261d958a7f7eab22af", "ja": "『ミリオンシアターシーズン・ファイナル』！？", "zh": "《百万剧场季度最终篇》！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "c07bd71e1552d935b1e017a9b11754e86997718b8f906f546897f36d312f7c5e", "ja": "うむ！　首都エリア各地で、成長した姿を披露する\n4公演を行うのだよ。それぞれのテーマは…", "zh": "嗯！将在首都地区各地举行4场公演，展示成长后的模样。每场公演的主题是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "4cfb18437970252d6c5aa23a017eb039d2c3d3081c14d93689dcd4c2741dbe70", "ja": "始まりを告げる朝の祝祭『RisingLight』公演！\n輝かしく光満ちる昼の祝祭『ShineLight』公演！", "zh": "宣告开始的清晨庆典“RisingLight”公演！\n光彩夺目、充满光芒的正午庆典“ShineLight”公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "596cf6165a5f1092ffaae06dba82f13375084bda8ad42276ee68ccbda5f4b72b", "ja": "黄昏の時を想う夕の祝祭『EmotionLight』公演！\n喜び弾ける夜の祝祭『FantasticLight』公演！", "zh": "追忆黄昏时光的晚间庆典《EmotionLight》公演！\n喜悦迸发的夜间庆典《FantasticLight》公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "0296593f160d5ac76fe03f9b1f9385b8de2f713205dbc615ef3038a27e1518f7", "ja": "これぞアイドル諸君の輝き……4つのLightだよ！\n……って。社長、思いついた時に叫んでましたから。", "zh": "这就是偶像们的光辉……4种Light啊！\n……话说回来，社长在想到这个点子时就是这么喊的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "ea3f4b07f23152882bf56df865d8089ec4346c14eb5e0233dbeb6bb6e8b0038b", "ja": "それは、いいアイディアが出たものだから……。\nうおっほん！　とにかくそういうことだよ、君。", "zh": "那是因为我想到了个好主意……。\n咳咳！总之就是这么回事，知道了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "1eefe848389800fd7277ad8ea3aaca864139c3f7028c6a07b1ec20ab0c036ea8", "ja": "それで、だ……このシーズン・ファイナルは、\n混成チームで行いたいと思うんだが、どうだろう？", "zh": "所以……这次赛季总决赛，我想让混合队伍参加，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "e270eabd3b4fd1db52b32ff8f5e43e399caf328cbd0dd850da8485ecf677ae37", "ja": "今までのツアーのチームを、という意味ですよね？\nいいですね、まさにカードを組み替えるように。", "zh": "你的意思是，要把之前巡演的队伍重新组合起来，对吧？\n不错，就像重新洗牌一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "9a61c9fa4d1f63dd8cb33b2ad093d346dad24368fe3318ad537735974c81d825", "ja": "そう！　ダイヤとクラブの混成メンバーで始まり、\nクラブとハート、ハートとスペード……", "zh": "没错！从钻石与梅花的混合成员开始，\n梅花与红心、红心与黑桃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "37a32bf6ac18f0430f0381a9a28e59c7c00823e71697f3bb9e9931661bc2fb9c", "ja": "そして、スペードとダイヤ！\nタスキを繋ぐように、互いの輝きを繋いで……", "zh": "然后是黑桃与方块！\n像传递接力带一样，将彼此的光辉连接起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "c52249cb0ef1dec8b0b99bf6e419ae27fb4f778b8815fb799d46a1d26b3385c0", "ja": "アイドルの原点にして聖地、\n武道館での公演で、ラストを迎えるのだ！", "zh": "在偶像的发源地与圣地——武道馆的公演中，迎来最后一幕吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "66c17872d7079b21c19ca89b8cf5073b3053f2e022ae04c75afe3f56a74be012", "ja": "武道館！？　それは……！", "zh": "武道馆！？那可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_1036", "source_sha256": "63101b58f7ec4fc3dd2b9913149c75ffb99cc547ede001f22ac6bca69af3e896", "ja": "やらせてください！", "zh": "请让我来做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "db50284c40a87a43f345d59fa6e6862ee1dae73a0772a48c21e0ba43adb0cf9b", "ja": "是非、挑戦させてください！\n今のアイドル達なら、必ず成功させられるはずです！", "zh": "请务必让我来挑战！\n以现在这些偶像们的实力，一定能让它成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "97c1dc75852757678bbf1b1a68396c169c263ae9444d2d14314b09479cef1c73", "ja": "はっ！？　{$P$}さんの瞳まで、\nキラキラと輝いて……！", "zh": "啊！？连{$P$}先生的眼睛都闪闪发亮了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "d167208ef2b3f4c597d63cc58b57f2f38eba0c02aed7a72dc8c450afe5035697", "ja": "はっはっは、いい食いつきだ！\nもちろん、プロデュースは君に任せるつもりだよ。", "zh": "哈哈哈，真是干劲十足！\n当然，我打算把制作工作交给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "0081d27f55d6ddf5182c8bd09b5847405f55ebcc135c6b5f932e2da5ec983b40", "ja": "このシーズン・ファイナルは、ツアーの集大成で\nあると同時に、アイドル諸君の歩みの集大成でもある。", "zh": "本赛季最终公演既是巡演的集大成，  \n也是各位偶像一路走来的集大成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_2004_president", "source_sha256": "c1cde2e13bf4d942fbf2d971650d229f3f4991f993df4e84b72dc718ee2869f3", "ja": "諸君の成長と、ファン達への感謝を示すために……。\nひとつ、気合いを入れて頼むよ～！", "zh": "为了展现你们的成长，以及对粉丝们的感谢……\n这次就请拿出干劲，好好拜托你们啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "f0927fc277fe1d586c6d045516d732a51e024c3844813b89641e2098f89de2c5", "ja": "（首都圏でのツアー、そして、武道館での\nグランドフィナーレ……これはきっと盛り上がるぞ！）", "zh": "（首都地区巡演，再加上武道馆的最终大公演……这一定会非常热闹！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "4e1853cce8ec99262f4bfc57b95073a3211d01d8b1151c1d3768e407bb31747c", "ja": "（早く劇場に帰って、プランを練らないと！）", "zh": "（得赶紧回剧场制定计划才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
